Name: Windows Brute Force - 4 Failed Logons

Time Range:
Earliest: -10m@m
Latest: now

Schedule:
*/5 * * * *

Scheduling:
Continuous

Trigger Condition:
Number of Results > 0

Trigger:
Once

Throttling:
10 minutes

Group By:
host

index=* host="<WINDOWS_HOST>" source="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=4625
| stats count as failed_logins by host
| where failed_logins >= 4
